#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]corresponding bead and every PR not created by SASE's tracked [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]workflow has a corresponding Patch, kept current continuously by [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]AXE on every enabled project on the machine, and the Artifacts tab [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]presents those relationships on one integrated surface whose [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]sub-tabs are Stitches, Patches, Beads, Files.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]external_artifact_ingestion.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/external_artifact_ingestion.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-jd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-jd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]external_ref bead identity field[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]bead_ref[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead_ref: add the nullable, partially-unique external_ref column to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-core bead schema and thread it through wire, jsonl, events, read, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mutation, CLI, history, and search plus the Python mirrors; add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project-qualified external ref normalizer and widen bug_links to task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads through it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pull-request provider seam[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pr_seam[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pr_seam: add PullRequestWire, vcs_list_pull_requests, and split [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list/read/mutate capability probes to the VCS provider boundary, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]implement them in sase-github over gh pr list, extend the in-memory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fake, and add provider_id to IssueWire.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]PR_ORIGIN field, SASE_PATCH stamp, and the external-Patch [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]safety exclusion[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]pr_origin[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pr_origin: add the tri-state PR_ORIGIN Patch field across parser, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]storage, section order, and the four ACE styling surfaces; stamp [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]SASE_PATCH in append_pr_tags; and structurally exclude external Patches [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from AXE work before any importer can create one.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]external_issue_mirror chop[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]issue_mirror[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bead_ref[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]issue_mirror: add the per-project builtin chop that diffs the tracker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]against beads on external_ref and creates unsized open task beads, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]watermarks, a resumable backfill, per-pass budgets, backoff, a daily [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair scan, a dry run, and a doctor check for detached tracker auth.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]external_pr_mirror chop and the two-file Patch importer[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]pr_mirror[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pr_seam, pr_origin[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pr_mirror: add the per-project builtin chop that adopts uno